OL,3,GNEWSAHealth mulls regulation of
OL,4,Acosmetic industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FProviders of botox and fillers in
OL,7,FGuernsey could be regulated under new
OL,8,Fplans from the Committee for Health and
OL,9,FSocial Care (HSC).
OL,11,FThe suggestion was included in the
OL,12,Fcommittee's workplan for this political
OL,13,Fterm, alongside plans to regulate
OL,14,Fmedicinal cannabis clinics and give
OL,15,Fpeople who aren't doctors powers to
OL,16,Fprescribe medicines.
OL,18,FHSC's top priority remains plans to
OL,19,Fdevelop a new model for care in
OL,20,FGuernsey, which could see patients
OL,21,Fpaying more for healthcare in the
OL,22,Ffuture.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
